  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">State of the Education Report India 2025: Mother Tongue Based &amp; Multilingual ED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO will develop the 2025 State of the Education Report for India on Mother Tongue-Based and Multilingual Education (MTB-MLE) at a critical moment, MTB-MLE stands at the center of India&#x2019;s education discourse. This initiative positions UNESCO to present compelling evidence-based arguments establishing MTB-MLE as the foundation for educational inclusion, linguistic diversity preservation, and enhanced learning outcomes.</narrative>
